# an unknown flag
$ skills sync-manifest --frobnicate
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: skills sync-manifest: unknown flag "--frobnicate"

--- overlay.manifest ---
ghost/SKILL.md custom

# a short flag
$ skills sync-manifest -v
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: skills sync-manifest: unknown flag "-v"

--- overlay.manifest ---
ghost/SKILL.md custom

# the equals form of a flag it reads
$ skills sync-manifest --manifest=<WORLD>/overlay.manifest
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: skills sync-manifest: unknown flag "--manifest=<WORLD>/overlay.manifest"

--- overlay.manifest ---
ghost/SKILL.md custom

